important file.figma · Some file.scratch · List of something.xd · Very important file.svg — each 7.5 MB · 3.22.22, 11:15 AM\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"7:90\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"64\" y=\"3440\" width=\"1312\" height=\"332\">\n      <text id=\"7:91\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"328\" height=\"35\" />\n      <frame id=\"7:92\" name=\"Fixed vs yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"281\">\n        <frame id=\"7:93\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"221\">\n          <text id=\"7:94\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"103\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"7:95\" name=\"• Frame list and exact names • Must-include content per frame (what, not how) • Navigation structure and links • All data and copy • Brand color #5051F9 and DM Sans • Media: logo, avatars, photos, icons • Default Button, default Text Field\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"140\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"7:96\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"281\">\n          <text id=\"7:97\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"197\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"7:98\" name=\"• Layout, grid, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen • All other colors: neutrals, text, surfaces, chart and bar colors, tag colors, status / progress colors, online status, error / disabled • Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation • All states: current nav item, current period tab, current settings tab, current conversation, unread, typing, hover, focused field • Sidebar, top bar, stat cards, charts, task rows, schedule card, message rows, gantt rows and bars, kanban columns and cards, chat bubbles, folders, file table, storage panel, profile header, tabs, form, contact panel • How avatars, covers and photos are cropped\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"200\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"7:99\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"64\" y=\"3820\" width=\"1312\" height=\"281\">\n      <text id=\"7:100\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"222\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"7:101\" name=\"Your file is compared with this brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any original.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <text id=\"7:102\" name=\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data &amp; copy accuracy 3. Flow &amp; prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality &amp; consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (current nav, tabs, conversation, unread / typing)\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"154\" />\n      <text id=\"7:103\" name=\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 6 named frames, your components and the prototype.\" x=\"0\" y=\"259\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}],"_meta":{"mcpRequestId":"0e904451-3140-4340-8bd6-03d128105a5f"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01XZ8ciOKym4SNKxqNYBjiOP","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
