{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNnytP6yU8rOb5q2hZv4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to build 6 Figma frames (Dashboard, User Stats, Messages, Today's Tasks, New Task, Settings) at a canvas size of 1440x1024 in the existing design file. I first check for the figma-use skill resource, and since no skill resource tool is listed, I proceed carefully.\n\nI decide to build everything programmatically rather than instancing components across pages, which carries risk. Instead I use instance() of the existing icons, avatars, and photos directly from the components on pages 1:2 and 1:4, satisfying the reuse of 04 Media assets. I split the work into multiple calls because of the 50k character limit per call.\n\nFor the design system I plan a sidebar 88px wide, a top bar 72px high, content background #F5F6FA, brand color #5051F9, text #1A1A1F, and muted text #6B7280. Content starts at x=116 with width 1296, split into a left column of 800 and a right rail of 472 with a 24px gap.\n\nI first probe the available DM Sans font styles (Regular, Medium, Semi Bold, Bold) and inspect an icon component's stroke data before writing any frames, so recoloring via vector","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":33743,"input_tokens":1,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":33743}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6b035988-a95d-4967-90e1-871b84812e81","uuid":"b3254883-e1b7-4c72-911c-118142b2d58b","timestamp":"2026-11-01T21:54:39.924Z","thinking_duration_ms":29601}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNnytP6yU8rOb5q2hZv4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QUtwwljzk7eNagQDurWvjC","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const fonts = await figma.listAvailableFontsAsync();\nconst dm = fonts.filter(f=>f.fontName.family==='DM Sans').map(f=>f.fontName.style);\nconst bell = figma.getNodeById('6:7');\nconst vecs = bell.findAll(n=>n.type==='VECTOR').map(v=>({strokes:JSON.stringify(v.strokes).slice(0,200), sw:v.strokeWeight, caps:v.strokeCap, scene:JSON.stringify(v.strokeWeight)}));\nconst av = figma.getNodeById('6:43');\nconst comps = figma.root.children.find(p=>p.id==='1:4').findAll(n=>n.type==='COMPONENT').map(c=>c.name);\nreturn JSON.stringify({dm, vecs, avSize:av.width, comps});","description":"Probe DM Sans font styles and icon stroke details","fileKey":"abw7NWHcVhT1nBRyk8G1Ya"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":33743,"input_tokens":1,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":33743}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6b035988-a95d-4967-90e1-871b84812e81","uuid":"85e99338-0124-4379-9e7d-b5978cbe0e7e","timestamp":"2026-11-01T21:54:42.136Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01QUtwwljzk7eNagQDurWvjC","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
