2 folder grid plus a Recent Files table and a right rail with Activity Chart and Storage at 140GB/512GB = 27%. Settings has a cover banner, avatar, Cancel/Save, and 8 tabs with My details current. Messages uses 300 list + flex conversation + 300 contact panel, with a \"Today, March 24\" divider, a 1:25 voice message, and 4 attachments.\n\nThe component library sits at (3120, 0) with sets for Button (Primary, Secondary, Ghost, Icon), NavItem (Default, Current), and Tab (Default, Current), plus single components for StatCard, TaskRow, MessageRow, KanbanCard, FolderCard, FileRow, ChatBubble, StorageRow, and GanttBar. Screens place at (0,0), (1560,0), (0,1120), (1560,1120), (0,2240), (1560,2240). Prototype links run from sidebar icons to each screen and the Dashboard message row to 06_Messages.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":35202,"input_tokens":1,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":35202}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6b035988-a95d-4967-90e1-871b84812e81","uuid":"fc8a1f0b-5581-461a-8242-34fe28105121","timestamp":"2026-11-01T21:56:12.030Z","thinking_duration_ms":80621}
