{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNo9uKwgG9YLnUM5klhw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking for a full design system build inside a single use_figma call: tokens, core components (Sidebar with 6 variants, TopBar, Button, Input, Tab, Tag, StatCard, and the business components), reused from the library components, plus a token sheet.\n\nI start with the palette: brand #5051F9, brand dark #3D3EE0, tint #EEEEFE, ink #0F1021, secondary #5A5C7A, muted #8A8CA9, line #ECEFF6, bg #F5F6FA. Radii: 16 for cards, 10 for controls, 999 for pills. Shadows: 0 4px 16px rgba(16,17,33,0.05). Type scale: 28/34 Bold, 22/28 Bold, 16/22 SemiBold, 14/20 Regular, 12/16, 11/14.\n\nThe Sidebar is 96 wide and 1024 tall, white with a 1px right border of #ECEFF6. The Logo_Octom instance scales to 26px at x=35, y=28. The wordmark splits into two text nodes: \"OCTOM\" at 11px Bold with letterSpacing 0.4 in ink, and \".\" in brand, both centered at y=62. Nav items start at y=120: 48×48 items centered at x=24 with 12 spacing, 6 items total, so 6*48 + 5*12 = 348, ending at y=468. The current item is a brand-filled pill with radius 14 and a white icon; the others carry #8A8CA9 icons. Order: Dashboard, Timeline, Task, Settings, Messages, Files.\n\nIcons come from the library 24px set, rescaled to 20, with strokeWeight settling near 1.5 after rescale; vectors are recolored per state.\n\nThe TopBar is 1344×76: a 320×40 search field at x=32, y=18 with an 18px Icon_Search in muted and placeholder \"Search anything...\"; on the right, a 40×40 bell with a badge reading \"2\", a divider, an avatar at 40 plus a 16px Icon_Chevron_Down, right padding 32.\n\nButtons: Button/Primary comes from an instance of the library Button (160×44, indigo, DM Sans Medium 14, white, radius 8) via createComponentFromNode, so the library asset stays the source. Secondary and Ghost are duplicates with overrides: Secondary is white with a #EEF0F7 border and ink text, Ghost is transparent with indigo text. Input/Default is the library Text Field instance made into a component; Input/Focused and Input/Error are duplicates with border and helper-text overrides. Tab/Default and Tab/Current, Tag variants (Design #EEEEFE/#5051F9, Research #E6F7F4/#12A594, Planning #FFF4E5/#D9822B, Content #FDECF2/#D6336C), and StatCard (icon tile, value, label, trend, change) round out the set.\n\nVariants become a component set via combineAsVariants; instances are picked per screen rather than through properties. The token sheet sits on the workspace page as a frame showing swatches, type scale, radii and shadows, with the library block to the left and the 6 screens at 1440×1024 stacked at y=0, 1120, 2240, 3360, 4480 and 5600, each with a 100 gap.\n\nScreens use a content frame 1344×948 at y=76. Dashboard splits into a 880 main column and a 368 rail: 3 stat cards at 132 high each, the Task Done chart at 280, and Tasks at about 340; the rail holds New Task (~258), Messages (~300) and Today's Schedule (~240). Timeline keeps a 260 label column against 18 day columns at roughly 56.6 each, with a 320 Complete Task card on the right. Task board gives 4 columns of (940 - 3*16)/4 = 223 in a 940 area plus a 320 rail for Members and Group Chat. Files keeps 880 for All Files (3×2 folders) and Recent Files, 368 for Activity Chart and Available Storage. Messages runs 340 + 600 + 300. Settings takes a Photo_Gradient_Blue cover with an overlapping avatar, Settings title, Cancel/Save, tabs and a form card.\n\nBusiness components come","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":36001,"input_tokens":1,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":36001}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6b035988-a95d-4967-90e1-871b84812e81","uuid":"ba35956c-ebb1-4ecf-85cc-e0f8a8aaf24d","timestamp":"2026-11-01T21:57:46.697Z","thinking_duration_ms":81519}
