{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNp32483snUhAB8rupcd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to fix the chart line offset. The line keeps the same shape as the markers but sits shifted by a constant amount, up-left by roughly the bbox origin: near May the line is at y~375 while the marker is at ~390, and near Apr 360 vs 372. The vector node has x=0, y=0 while minY=59.2, so the path is drawn offset by that origin.\n\nThe deterministic fix is to normalize the path data itself so the bbox starts at (0,0), then set node x=minX and y=minY. I subtract minX and minY from every point in the data, then assign v.x=minX, v.y=minY. The markers already use absolute coordinates, so they need no change. This same normalization also explains why the in-progress line sits above the completed one where it should sit below.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":88740,"input_tokens":1,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":88740}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6b035988-a95d-4967-90e1-871b84812e81","uuid":"61805962-19ed-4dfa-92a7-f8747428183f","timestamp":"2026-11-01T22:07:50.420Z","thinking_duration_ms":12948}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNp32483snUhAB8rupcd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01xhyAkhKSQfg49oq447aGG4","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const page=figma.getNodeById('8:2');await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nconst P='#5051F9';\nconst rgb=h=>{const n=parseInt(h.slice(1),16);return {r:((n>>16)&255)/255,g:((n>>8)&255)/255,b:(n&255)/255};};\nconst fl=h=>[{type:'SOLID',color:rgb(h),opacity:1}];\nconst N=page.children;const F=N.find(n=>n.name==='01_Dashboard');const ct=F.children.find(n=>n.name==='Content');\nconst chartC=ct.children.find(n=>n.name==='Task Done Card');const plot=chartC.children.find(n=>n.name==='Plot');\nplot.children.filter(c=>c.type==='VECTOR').forEach(c=>c.remove());\nfunction path(parent,pts,color,w){\n  const minX=Math.min(...pts.map(p=>p[0])), minY=Math.min(...pts.map(p=>p[1]));\n  const loc=pts.map(p=>[p[0]-minX,p[1]-minY]);\n  let d='M '+loc[0][0]+' '+loc[0][1];\n  for(let i=1;i<loc.length;i++)d+=' L '+loc[i][0]+' '+loc[i][1];\n  const v=figma.createVector();parent.appendChild(v);\n  v.vectorPaths=[{windingRule:'NONE',data:d}];\n  v.fills=[];v.strokes=fl(color);v.strokeWeight=w;v.strokeCap='ROUND';v.strokeJoin='ROUND';\n  v.x=minX;v.y=minY;\n  return [v.x,v.y,v.width,v.height];\n}\nconst y1=160,W=766,mk=v=>v.map((x,i)=>[i*(W/11),y1-(x/400)*y1]);\nconst r1=path(plot,mk([240,310,262,340,292,330,252,312,272,300,332,286]),P,2.5);\nconst r2=path(plot,mk([120,168,142,200,172,190,150,182,162,150,192,172]),'#9BC7FF',2.5);\nreturn JSON.stringify({r1,r2,plotW:plot.width});","description":"Rebuild chart polylines with normalized paths","fileKey":"abw7NWHcVhT1nBRyk8G1Ya"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":88740,"input_tokens":1,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":88740}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6b035988-a95d-4967-90e1-871b84812e81","uuid":"39721da8-6d8c-40d4-9d6d-21920de99eb9","timestamp":"2026-11-01T22:07:55.084Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01xhyAkhKSQfg49oq447aGG4","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
